OL,3,GNEWSABrother's death prompts
OL,4,Acontaminated drugs warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis sister Dawn French said she was
OL,7,Ftold by police that there was a
OL,8,Fcontaminated strain of the synthetic
OL,9,Fdrug on the streets of Birmingham.
OL,10,FSpeaking on BBC Radio WM, French said:
OL,11,F"I don't think this is just a cannabis
OL,12,For you know, I don't think this drug is
OL,13,Fsafe. This is not safe."
OL,15,FWest Midlands Police said they were
OL,16,Fworking to investigate whether her
OL,17,Fbrother's death was linked to
OL,18,Fpotentially contaminated drugs.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
